    "body": "In `FrameLoader::SubframeLoader::loadOrRedirectSubframe` we have this\r\n```\r\n        if (upgradedRequestURL.protocolIsJavaScript()) {\r\n            Ref ownerDocument = ownerElement.document();\r\n            ownerDocument->incrementLoadEventDelayCount();\r\n            stopDelayingLoadEvent = [ownerDocument = WTFMove(ownerDocument)] (ScheduleLocationChangeResult) {\r\n                ownerDocument->decrementLoadEventDelayCount();\r\n            };\r\n        }\r\n```\r\nwhich seems more locally managed than this PR. I'm not super familiar with the entire setup however. Maybe @achristensen07 is.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
